date.ItemsAdded the EMP Launcher item. It can be crafted at higher research lab levels or purchased from certain merchants.Added blueprint items. They can be purchased from village merchant NPCs.Added new food items.Vehicle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:29:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035844","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:29:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175810-1846651706689915","game_id":"steam-4175810","kind":"update","title":"Space Daram Demo Update #3","summary":"This demo update brings a total of 27 improvements and bug fixes, including new space travel events and UI enhancements.ImprovementsShips & NavigationAdded space travel events.Updated the landing sequence.The travel timer is now hidden during ship events.MapVehicle icons are now displayed on the map.ItemsFood items now display the correct models when held.Added visual effects to EMP gun projectiles.NPCs & CompanionsRemoved ranged attacks from enemy eagle robots.Added rabbit robot enemies.Expande","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:02:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689915","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175810-1846651706677084","game_id":"steam-4175810","kind":"update","title":"Space Daram Demo Update #2","summary":"This demo update brings a total of 26 improvements and bug fixes, including enhancements to building and UI usability.ImprovementsShips & NavigationThe remaining travel time is now displayed at the top of the screen during space travel.MapAdded landing instructions to the top of the star system map.BuildingStructures can now be rotated when placing them.Building material requirements are now shown in red when you do not have enough materials.Added a model for the basic floor.VehiclesImproved veh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:22:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175810-1846018067943846","game_id":"steam-4175810","kind":"update","title":"Space Daram Demo Update #1","summary":"This demo update will include 20 improvements and bug fixes, including a new logo video and improvements to the refinery’s work queue.ImprovementsTitle ScreenAdded a logo video that plays when the game starts.ItemsAdded rewards to boss chests.Refining & CraftingImproved the refinery so that items can be added to the queue even after processing has started.BuildingFloors, walls, and similar structures can no longer be built on top of base modules.CombatReplaced the enemy ship model featured in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T12:14:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175810-1846018067930712","game_id":"steam-4175810","kind":"announcement","title":"SPACE DARAM Demo Is Here! Join Us on Our First Adventure. 🚀","summary":"The SPACE DARAM demo is out now!Hello, explorers!We've been waiting for you aboard our acorn ship.Now it's time to explore space together in the SPACE DARAM demo! 🚀We still have some polishing to do. If you encounter any bugs or anything that feels frustrating, please let us know what happened. We'd also love to hear your thoughts on your adventures.We'll carefully review your reports and feedback, and keep releasing updates with fixes and improvements as we work toward the full release.Thank yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:04:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930712","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4175810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4175810":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4175810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z"},"5235950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4175810","app_id":4175810,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"771fb5c0060731c1a38521cff11b211e7444e2200ea29815fbedf188ef0e972b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"귀여운 우주 다람쥐가 되어 동료들과 함께 함선을 운영하고 낯선 행성을 탐험하며 기지를 건설하는 SF 생존 게임입니다. 전력을 생산하고 자원을 정제해 다양한 물건을 만들고, 여러 외계 종족과 교류하며 우주 속 나만의 거점을 확장해 보세요. 친구와 함께 멀티플레이를 하거나 싱글플레이로 개척에 도전해서 특별한 여정을 즐겨보세요!","publishers":[{"name":" Happy Daram Inc."}],"developers":[{"name":" Happy Daram Inc."}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801616400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"SPACE DARAM - Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1787895419","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filenam